# Derived model objects: MATLAB's fitlm stores the full training data inside the
# LinearModel object, so these carry 附件2 observation-level data. Regenerate with
# Math_Model/question_2/Ct_Cp_model_from_Q2.m instead of committing them.
/Math_Model/mdl_Cp.mat
/Math_Model/mdl_Ct.mat

